<a href="publications.html">Publications</a>
<a href="portal/">Portal</a>
<a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
<a class="nav-button" href="request-review.html">Request Technical Review</a>
</nav>
</header>

<main>

<section class="hero">
<div class="eyebrow">MEIFERTS™ Building Intelligence</div>

<h1>The Building Behind The Brochure.</h1>

<p class="lead">
Technical Due Diligence and Building Intelligence for property buyers, investors and asset owners.
</p>

<p class="hero-text">
Most buyers investigate the location.
<br><br>
Few investigate the building.
<br><br>
That imbalance creates risk.
<br><br>
MEIFERTS exists to close that gap.
</p>

<div class="actions">
<a class="button primary" href="request-review.html">Request Technical Review</a>
<a class="button" href="methodology/">Explore Methodology</a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="figure-section">
<div class="figure-scroll">
<img src="meiferts-research-v3%202.svg" alt="Building Performance Over Time">
</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<div class="section-eyebrow">Why Buildings Create Risk</div>
<h2>Most risks are invisible during a viewing.</h2>

<p>
A building can appear attractive during a viewing while significant technical, financial and operational risks remain undiscovered.
</p>

<p>
Deferred maintenance. Water intrusion. Building envelope failure. Electrical deficiencies. Governance issues. Future capital expenditure.
</p>

<p>
Most become visible only after the purchase.
</p>

<p>
That is where Technical Due Diligence begins.
</p>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<div class="section-eyebrow">The MEIFERTS Standard™</div>
<h2>Observe. Understand. Evaluate. Decide.</h2>

<p>
The MEIFERTS Standard™ transforms building observations into decision clarity.
</p>

<p>
The objective is not to create more information. The objective is to create understanding.
</p>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<div class="section-eyebrow">What We Do</div>
<h2>Building Intelligence for better decisions.</h2>

<p>
MEIFERTS translates building complexity into structured decision support.
</p>

<div class="standard-grid">
<div class="standard-card">
<h3>Technical Property Review™</h3>
<p>Identify visible and hidden technical risks before acquisition.</p>
</div>

<div class="standard-card">
<h3>Building Risk Score™</h3>
<p>Transform technical observations into a structured risk classification.</p>
</div>

<div class="standard-card">
<h3>Lifecycle Assessment™</h3>
<p>Evaluate asset maturity, remaining useful life and future risk drivers.</p>
</div>

<div class="standard-card">
<h3>CAPEX Forecast™</h3>
<p>Understand future capital expenditure before it becomes unavoidable.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<div class="section-eyebrow">What We Evaluate</div>
<h2>Beyond what can be seen during a viewing.</h2>

<div class="evaluation-grid">
<div>Structure</div>
<div>Roofing</div>
<div>Building Envelope</div>
<div>Water Intrusion</div>
<div>Electrical Systems</div>
<div>Mechanical Systems</div>
<div>Maintenance Culture</div>
<div>Reserve Funds</div>
<div>Governance</div>
<div>Future CAPEX</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<div class="section-eyebrow">Who We Work With</div>
<h2>Built for decision makers.</h2>

<div class="client-grid">
<div>Property Buyers</div>
<div>International Investors</div>
<div>Cross-Border Investors</div>
<div>Asset Owners</div>
<div>Family Offices</div>
<div>Real Estate Advisors</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="behind-section">
<div class="behind-panel">
<div class="section-eyebrow">Who Is Behind MEIFERTS</div>
<h2>Experience translated into clarity.</h2>

<p>
MEIFERTS Building Intelligence combines more than 25 years of real estate experience with technical property management, lifecycle thinking and structured risk assessment.
</p>

<p>
The objective is not to create more information.
</p>

<p>
The objective is to create understanding.
</p>

<p>
Understanding creates confidence. Confidence enables better decisions.
</p>
</div>

<div class="behind-panel">
<div class="section-eyebrow">Platform Logic</div>
<h2>Workspace as professional tool.</h2>

<p>
The public website explains the methodology, reports and research.
</p>

<p>
The internal workspace is used as professional inspection tooling: checklist, risk engine, lifecycle assessment, CAPEX logic and report preparation.
</p>

<p>
Clients see clarity. The workspace remains the craft behind the decision.
</p>

<div class="signature">
Every building tells a story.<br>
Understanding it is where better decisions begin.
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
<div class="section-eyebrow">Research & Publications</div>
<h2>Building Intelligence as a knowledge system.</h2>

<div class="article-grid">
<div class="article-card">The Most Expensive Question Property Buyers Never Ask</div>
<div class="article-card">Your Condo Isn't The Risk. The Building Is.</div>
<div class="article-card">Reserve Funds Matter More Than Marble Floors.</div>
<div class="article-card">The Building Behind The Brochure.</div>
</div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
<div class="footer-inner">
<div>
<h3>MEIFERTS BUILDING INTELLIGENCE™</h3>
